genocidable characters (including humans), except for nymphs, unicorns, and
jabberwocks.  I chose to keep these because:

- nymphs have potions and tools, which are useful for making magic markers
  and horns of plenty (must make sure I don't starve, eh?)
- unicorns have horns, which (in this version, unlike some previous ones)
